# NOTICE / Attribution

## Scoring policy (GPL-3.0 derivative)

`uma-sim-core/src/scoring/` includes a Rust port of training/event scoring
ideas from steve1316's `scoring-shared` Kotlin Multiplatform module
(https://github.com/steve1316/uma-android-automation, GPL-3.0).
This repository is therefore distributed under GPL-3.0-only.
Exception: the `uma-race-core` crate is dual-licensed `MIT OR Apache-2.0`
per its own manifest; the full texts ship in `uma-race-core/LICENSE-MIT`
and `uma-race-core/LICENSE-APACHE`.

## Data sources (community / third-party)

- GameTora (https://gametora.com) — skill/support/trainee tables used to build
  `knowledge/canonical/`
- uma.guide, Game8, umamusu.wiki — scenario formula notes in `research/`
- umalator / uma-skill-tools — race geometry and checkpoint fixtures
  (fixture data only; no GPL TypeScript source is vendored)

